  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Installation of air source heat pump",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p paraid=&quot;1832933069&quot;&gt;The proposed installation of an air source heat pump&amp;nbsp;fails to provide evidence to demonstrate that it would not unreasonably impact the amenity of both adjacent neighbours due to insufficient information being provided with regards to the current underlying background noise level. In view of the absence of this information, it&amp;nbsp;could not be established that the proposal would accord with the requirements of Policy 57&amp;nbsp;of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p paraid=&quot;1832933069&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the first reason for refusal, the proposed location of the air source heat pump is considered unacceptable by virtue of its overall position in the front garden of the dwelling, on an elevated platform, in addition to its&amp;nbsp;bulk and design without any attempt to reduce its visual appearance,&amp;nbsp;would be an unduly dominant addition to the principle elevation&amp;nbsp;of the property&amp;nbsp;facing the street scene,&amp;nbsp;contrary to Policy 53&amp;nbsp;of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan Part 1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
